#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:1
msgid "HM-D13-4G"
msgstr "HM-D13-4G"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:3
msgid "产品定位"
msgstr "Product overview"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:6
msgid ""
"**面向地面移动作业的紧凑型双频一体化 RTK 接收机。** 集成 GNSS 天线、定位计算"
"单元与 4G 通信链路，通过蜂窝网络接入 CORS/NTRIP。"
msgstr ""
"**A compact dual-band integrated RTK GNSS receiver for ground-mobile "
"applications.** It combines a GNSS antenna, positioning engine, and 4G "
"correction link, connecting to CORS/NTRIP over a cellular network."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:9
msgid "HM-D13-4G 一体化 RTK 接收机"
msgstr "HM-D13-4G Integrated RTK GNSS Receiver"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:14
msgid "核心价值"
msgstr "Key benefits"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:16
msgid ""
"**紧凑型一体化设计**：GNSS 天线、定位计算单元与 4G 通信链路集成在设备内部，外"
"部安装简洁。"
msgstr ""
"**Compact all-in-one design**: The GNSS antenna, positioning engine, and 4G "
"correction link are integrated inside the device for a clean external "
"installation."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:17
msgid "**无需本地基站**：通过 4G 接入 CORS/NTRIP，适合跨区域和分散作业。"
msgstr ""
"**No local base station required**: Access CORS/NTRIP via 4G, suitable for "
"cross-regional and distributed operations."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:18
msgid ""
"**单接口接入主机**：外部 5-pin GH1.25 mm 接口完成供电、UART 和 PPS 连接。"
msgstr ""
"**Single-interface host connection**: The external 5-pin GH1.25 mm interface "
"completes power supply, UART, and PPS connections."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:19
msgid ""
"**输出灵活**：可按交付用途配置 NMEA 或 UBX；默认 10 Hz NMEA，便于接入机器人主"
"控、PC 和通用串口设备。"
msgstr ""
"**Flexible output**: Supports NMEA or UBX as configured at delivery; the "
"default 10 Hz NMEA output works with robot controllers, PCs, and general "
"serial devices."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:21
msgid "工作方式"
msgstr "How it works"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:23
msgid "![HM-D13-4G通过4G接入CORS](../images/scenarios/d13-4g-ref-v2.png)"
msgstr ""
"![HM-D13-4G Accessing CORS via 4G](../images/scenarios/d13-4g-ref-v2.png)"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:23
msgid "HM-D13-4G通过4G接入CORS"
msgstr "HM-D13-4G accesses CORS through 4G"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:25
msgid ""
"设备接收 GNSS 卫星信号，并通过 4G 网络获取 CORS/NTRIP 差分数据；完成 RTK 解算"
"后，通过 5-pin GH1.25 mm 接口向外部设备输出定位结果。"
msgstr ""
"The device receives GNSS satellite signals and obtains CORS/NTRIP correction "
"data via the 4G network; after completing RTK solution computation, it "
"outputs the positioning results to external devices through a 5-pin GH1.25 "
"mm interface."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:27
msgid "交付组成"
msgstr "Package contents"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:29
msgid "HM-D13-4G 移动站。"
msgstr "HM-D13-4G rover."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:30
msgid ""
"供电与串口线缆、USB-C 配置线和兼容 3.3 V UART I/O 的 USB 转 UART 转接器。"
msgstr ""
"Includes power and serial cables, a USB-C configuration cable, and a USB-to-"
"UART adapter compatible with 3.3 V UART I/O."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:33
msgid ""
"使用前提 用户需要自行准备**有流量的 Nano-SIM 卡、可用的 CORS/NTRIP 账号和蜂窝"
"网络覆盖**。"
msgstr ""
"Prerequisites Before use, the user needs to prepare **a Nano-SIM card with "
"data, a valid CORS/NTRIP account, and cellular network coverage** on their "
"own."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:36
msgid "关键参数"
msgstr "Key specifications"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:32
msgid "项目"
msgstr "Item"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:32
msgid "参数"
msgstr "Parameter"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:32
msgid "定位类型"
msgstr "Positioning type"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:32
msgid "L1/L5 双频 RTK"
msgstr "L1/L5 Dual-Frequency RTK"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:32
msgid "RTK 精度"
msgstr "RTK accuracy"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:32
msgid "水平 1.0 cm + 1 ppm；垂直 1.5 cm + 1 ppm"
msgstr "Horizontal 1.0 cm + 1 ppm; Vertical 1.5 cm + 1 ppm"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:32
msgid "启动 / RTK 首次固定"
msgstr "Startup / RTK time to first fix"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:32
msgid "冷启动 28 s；热启动 1 s；RTK 首次固定 45 s"
msgstr "Cold start: 28 s; hot start: 1 s; RTK time to first fix: 45 s"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:32
msgid "输出协议"
msgstr "Output protocol"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:32
msgid "NMEA 或 UBX；默认 10 Hz NMEA"
msgstr "NMEA or UBX; default 10 Hz NMEA"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:32
msgid "RTK 最高更新率"
msgstr "Maximum RTK update rate"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:32
msgid "10 Hz"
msgstr "10 Hz"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:32
msgid "天线系统增益"
msgstr "Antenna system gain"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:32
msgid "40 dB"
msgstr "40 dB"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:32
msgid "主接口"
msgstr "Primary connector"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:32
msgid "5-pin GH1.25 mm；UART/PPS I/O 3.3 V；默认 115200 bps"
msgstr "5-pin GH1.25 mm; 3.3 V UART/PPS I/O; default 115200 bps"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:32
msgid "供电"
msgstr "Power input"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:32
msgid "5 V ±0.5 V（4.5–5.5 V）"
msgstr "5 V ±0.5 V (4.5–5.5 V)"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:32
msgid "工作电流"
msgstr "Operating current"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:32
msgid "典型 120 mA"
msgstr "Typical 120 mA"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:32
msgid "尺寸 / 重量"
msgstr "Dimensions / weight"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:32
msgid "Φ152 × 67.9 mm / 255 g"
msgstr "Φ152 × 67.9 mm / 255 g"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:32
msgid "工作 / 存储温度"
msgstr "Operating / Storage Temperature"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:32
msgid "-40–85 °C / -50–105 °C"
msgstr "-40–85 °C / -50–105 °C"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:52
msgid ""
"完整 GNSS 频点、灵敏度、动态条件和 LTE 频段请查看[产品对比与资料](../"
"comparison.md)。"
msgstr ""
"See [Product Comparison and Resources](../comparison.md) for complete GNSS "
"frequencies, sensitivity, dynamic limits, and LTE bands."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:54
msgid "外部接口"
msgstr "Interfaces"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:56
msgid ""
"**5-pin GH1.25 mm**：供电、3.3 V UART 和 3.3 V PPS 信号，按固定 Pin 顺序连"
"接。"
msgstr ""
"**5-pin GH1.25 mm**: Power, 3.3 V UART, and 3.3 V PPS; connect strictly by "
"pin number."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:57
msgid "**Nano-SIM 卡槽**：位于顶壳内部。"
msgstr "**Nano-SIM slot**: Located inside the top casing."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:58
msgid "**USB-C 配置口**：位于顶壳内部，使用标配配置线写入 CORS/NTRIP 账号。"
msgstr ""
"**USB-C Configuration Port**: Located inside the top case, use the standard "
"configuration cable to write CORS/NTRIP accounts."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:60
msgid ""
"安装或更换 SIM 卡、连接配置口时需要打开顶壳；完成操作后应恢复设备结构并确认装"
"配可靠。"
msgstr ""
"Open the top cover to install or replace the SIM card or access the "
"configuration port. Reassemble the enclosure securely after the operation."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:62
msgid "适用场景与前提"
msgstr "Applications and requirements"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-4g.md:64
msgid ""
"适合测绘、精准农业、智能驾驶测试、地面机器人和其他稳定安装的移动作业。现场需"
"要蜂窝网络覆盖；SIM 卡流量和 CORS/NTRIP 服务由用户管理。"
msgstr ""
"Suitable for surveying, precision agriculture, autonomous driving testing, "
"ground robots, and other stably mounted mobile operations. Cellular network "
"coverage is required on-site; SIM card data and CORS/NTRIP services are "
"managed by the user."

